<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>About OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke</h1>
    <p>Welcome to OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke, Kenya's most trusted resource for verifying online earning opportunities. Founded in 2024, our mission is to protect Kenyans from online scams while highlighting legitimate ways to earn money from home.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>We believe that every Kenyan with a smartphone and an internet connection should have the opportunity to earn a living online. However, the internet is filled with "get rich quick" schemes. We test, review, and verify every platform we feature to ensure it actually pays Kenyans via M-Pesa, PayPal, or local banks.</p>
    
    <h2>Why Trust Us?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Local Focus:</strong> We don't just copy global reviews. We test if the platform works specifically for Kenyans.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We clearly state the pros and cons, including withdrawal limits and fees.</li>
      <li><strong>Community Driven:</strong> Our reviews are updated based on feedback from thousands of Kenyan users.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>